{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2022-08-24 09:00:00', 'title': 'ANSYS AND AMD COLLABORATE TO SPEED SIMULATION OF LARGE STRUCTURAL MECHANICAL MODELS UP TO 6X FASTER', 'text': "ANSYS DELIVERS ONE OF THE FIRST COMMERCIAL FINITE ELEMENT ANALYSIS SOLVERS SUPPORTING AMD INSTINCT™ ACCELERATORS / KEY HIGHLIGHTS ANSYS IS INVESTING IN GRAPHICS PROCESSING UNITS (GPUS) AS AN EMERGING, SUSTAINABLE AND POWERFUL TECHNOLOGY GPUS ARE DESIGNED TO PROVIDE EXCEPTIONAL PERFORMANCE FOR DATA CENTERS AND SUPERCOMPUTERS TO SPEED DEVELOPMENT OF MORE EFFICIENT DESIGNS FOR CARS, PLANES AND CONSUMER PRODUCTS PITTSBURGH , AUG. 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ANSYS\xa0(NASDAQ: ANSS) ANNOUNCED THAT ANSYS® MECHANICAL™\xa0IS ONE OF THE FIRST COMMERCIAL FINITE ELEMENT ANALYSIS (FEA) PROGRAMS SUPPORTING AMD INSTINCT™ ACCELERATORS, THE NEWEST DATA CENTER GPUS FROM AMD. THE AMD INSTINCT™ ACCELERATORS ARE DESIGNED TO PROVIDE EXCEPTIONAL PERFORMANCE FOR DATA CENTERS AND SUPERCOMPUTERS TO HELP SOLVE THE WORLD'S MOST COMPLEX PROBLEMS."}